{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>美國饒舌歌手DON TOLIVER在英國一場演唱會，懷疑有人釋放催淚氣，逾1.2萬人要緊急疏散。</p><p></p><p>演唱會周日晚在曼徹斯特一座體育館舉行，當地緊急部門表示，在演唱會接近尾聲時，有人向群眾釋放疑似催淚氣，部分人出現眼部和呼吸道不適症狀，50多人接受醫生檢查，1人送院，警方正調查事件。</p><p></p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-23T13:14:58.955970+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":140,"images":0,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-23T12:11:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-23T13:08:10.798949+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-23T13:08:10.798949+00:00","content_hash":"1f4afe63658460b4173edc5b8deffc33e1a28fb86903894edd23b05b392dff90","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}